    "description": "I graduated from Skill Distillery's 16 week intensive full stack coding bootcamp in July 2020. During the 16 weeks, Skill Distillery required full days of instruction and coding from 8am-6pm Monday - Friday and weekend projects that would add an additional 20-30 hours of coding per weekend.\n\nThe first 6 weeks consisted of fundamentals of programming with Java, Object Oriented Programming in Java, Java libraries and Oracle Certified Associate practice tests and studying to solidify Java concepts.\n\nThe next 4 weeks consisted of Spring MVC, SQL, JDBC, Java Persistence API and an eight day midterm sprint building an application consisting of above with front end Java Server Pages.\n\nThe final 6 weeks consisted of Javascript, DOM Manipulation, Rest APIs, XHR, Angular and an eight day final spring building an application consisting of REST APIs, Spring Boot with Gradle Dependencies, JPA, MySQL and Angular.\n\nIn addition, HTML, CSS and Bootstrap was implemented in all projects after week 6.",
